<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  /* Basic styling to mimic document structure */
  body { font-family: "Liberation Serif", "DejaVu Serif", Georgia, serif; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td { padding: 5px 0; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-group { width: 48%; }
</style>

<div class="page">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <div>
            <h1 style="font-size: 24px; margin: 0;">MONTANA</h1>
            <h2 style="font-size: 24px; margin: 0;">STATE UNIVERSITY</h2>
            <h3 style="font-size: 20px; margin: 0;">BILLINGS</h3>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p style="margin: 0;">College of Education</p>
            <p style="margin: 0;">Application for EDCI S19</p>
            <h2 style="font-size: 18px; margin: 10px 0 5px 0;">Graduate Practicum Experience</h2>
            <p style="margin: 0;">Please Return Application to COE 261.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
                <p>Name:</p>
                <span data-field="full_name">{{ full_name }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group" style="text-align: right;">
                <p>E-Mail:</p>
                <span data-field="email">{{ email }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
                <p>ID Number:</p>
                <span data-field="id_number">{{ id_number }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group" style="text-align: right;">
                <p>Phone:</p>
                <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
                <p>Address:</p>
                <span data-field="address">{{ address }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group" style="text-align: right;">
                <p>City:</p>
                <span data-field="city">{{ city }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
                <p>State:</p>
                <span data-field="state">{{ state }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group" style="text-align: right;">
                <p>Zip Code:</p>
                <span data-field="zip_code">{{ zip_code }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
                <p>Semester requested:</p>
                <span data-field="semester_requested">{{ semester_requested }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group" style="text-align: right;">
                <p>Year:</p>
                <span data-field="year">{{ year }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
                <p>Section No. EDCI 219-:</p>
                <span data-field="section_number">{{ section_number }}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group" style="text-align: right;">
                <p>for course registration.</p>
                <span data-field="course_registration_details">{{ course_registration_details }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <table style="width: 100%; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th style="text-align: left; padding: 8px; width: 50%;">Teaching Major</th>
                <th style="text-align: left; padding: 8px; width: 25%;">2nd Teaching Major (If Applicable)</th>
                <th style="text-align: left; padding: 8px; width: 25%;">Minor or concentration (If Applicable)</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><span data-field="teaching_major">{{ teaching_major }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="second_teaching_major">{{ second_teaching_major }}</span></td>
                <td><span data-field="minor_concentration">{{ minor_concentration }}</span></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div style="width: 45%;">
            <p>Pre-Requisites</p>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 45%; text-align: right;">
            <p>Date</p>
            <p>ETP Admin's initials</p>
            <p>Room COE 261/219</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 10px;">Office Use Only</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <p>Admission to Educator Preparation Program.</p>
        <p>When do you plan to student teach?</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div style="width: 50%;">
            <p>Initial to indicate this important information has been read</p>
            <p>SEMINARS ARE MANDATORY – Seminars will be held 5 times per semester. Specific dates will be announced at the introductory seminar at the beginning of the semester.</p>
            <p>Field experience in a SUPERVISED classroom [NOT YOUR OWN CLASSROOM] for approximately six hours per week are needed to meet the 65 hours. Hours will be determined in consultation with the mentor teacher.</p>
            <p>Space is limited to the first 20 applicants and will be subject to first-come, first-serve and placement availability. Priority will be given to those students that will be student teaching the following semester AND have an application turned in by May 1st or December 15th. If registration is on or after the first day of classes in fall or spring semester, Kathy Holt must also sign off on this application BEFORE the student is registered for EDCI S19.</p>
            <p>Placements are made by the Field Experience Coordinators. Placements in Billings Public Schools cannot be guaranteed. You need to be open to other options in Yellowstone County.</p>
            <p>I understand that if I receive a grade lower than a C in my major(s) or minor courses, I will not be able to participate in Field/Clinic experience. I understand that I will be dropped from Field/Clinic experience if any grades are below a C. I will not be eligible until I have retaken the class and received a grade of C or higher and I will plan accordingly.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="width: 50%; text-align: right;">
            <p>Initial</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <p>Student's Signature (Required)</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Date</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <p>Education Advisor Signature (Required)</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Date</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <p>Kathy Holt Signature (if on or after the first day of classes)</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Date</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 20px;">Please Return Application to COE 261.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
        <div style="text-align: left;">
            <p>EDCI S19</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <p>Instructor's Signature</p>
            <p>Date</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>